4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,333
Question two, a number series!

5
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:12,467
Three, six, twelve,

6
00:00:12,467 --> 00:00:14,500
twenty-four, and then...

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:15,867
what comes next?

8
00:00:15,867 --> 00:00:18,200
A, thirty-six... B,

9
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,600
forty-eight... C, thirty...

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,500
or D, forty-two?

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,033
Five seconds!

12
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,133
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

13
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,133
It's... B, forty-eight!

14
00:00:35,133 --> 00:00:37,133
Each number simply doubles:

15
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:39,333
three, six, twelve,

16
00:00:39,333 --> 00:00:41,233
twenty-four... and twenty-four

17
00:00:41,233 --> 00:00:43,833
times two is forty-eight!

18
00:00:44,833 --> 00:00:47,300
Question ten! Which one does NOT

19
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,300
belong? Add... subtract...

20
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,267
multiply... number. A,

21
00:00:53,267 --> 00:00:56,067
add... B, subtract...

22
00:00:56,333 --> 00:00:59,067
C, multiply... or D,

23
00:00:59,067 --> 00:01:01,700
number? Five seconds!

24
00:01:07,367 --> 00:01:09,900
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

25
00:01:10,267 --> 00:01:12,800
It's... D, number!

26
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:15,467
Add, subtract, and multiply are

27
00:01:15,467 --> 00:01:16,767
